      "updated": 1785628800000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Because the write quorum and read quorum always share a node, a read can never miss the latest committed write —\nno consensus round-trip required, just a version check against numbers the storage nodes already hold.\nCrash recovery: Aurora restarts in under a minute because the storage layer applies the log continuously in the\nbackground; traditional engines replay single-threaded from the last checkpoint, typically ~5 minutes of log.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Because the write quorum and read quorum always share a node, a read can never miss the latest committed write — no consensus round-trip required, just a version check against numbers the storage nodes already hold. Crash recovery: Aurora restarts in under a minute because the storage layer applies the log continuously in the background; traditional engines replay single-threaded from the last checkpoint, typically ~5 minutes of log.",
